Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:52.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,To win this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must do 3 things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to break the demonic formation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to force him to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, hear my orders !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Assist the Sky Demon Envoy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:19.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,in breaching the city !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.29,0:02:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:32.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Full army
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,relocation !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,are courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:15.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of the Fire Demon !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our countries have fought for countless years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:19.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this is the first time the Fire Demon acted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:24.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,We Ancient Demon Spirits guard the 9 countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't interfere in wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if the Fire Demon senses my aura on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.05,0:03:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll come out enraged !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.97,0:03:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He isn't weaker than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be a true life or death trial for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.97,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1577,454)}Fire Demon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bei Luo's stench...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:50.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you lay a finger on my territory !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:51.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you broke the rules first,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the meaning of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,an Ancient Demon's wrath !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Order the army
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:10.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Entire army, retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You mere ants
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall be incinerated
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,never to be reborn !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fire Demon is too strong for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:26.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,withdraw !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you still think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can contend with me all alone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Devil Energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of this finger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far above your cultivation level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:41.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're still an ant trying to shake a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You attack so aggressively...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does Bei Luo expect to do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,by sending you here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he naive enough
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to think that you could beat me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,with your mere strength ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao of the Underworld...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Underworld River !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 000 000 strands of slaughter energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,fuse into one !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your strength alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be impossible to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the second thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to find a way to get within 100 zhang of him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.64,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 zhang = 3m
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and use this spell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,condense a body for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and allow me to fight the Fire Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This boy is just an Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sky Demon must have a plan if he sent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little ant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,this game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,has come to an end !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:11.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Slaughter !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:19.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fire Demon's Life Artifact !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:24.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given the gap in cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:35.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Stop Spell will last for less than a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:36.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it should be enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useless tricks !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm within 100 zhang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bei Luo !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you break the restriction to leave the city ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the aura of an Ancient God !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,By using his blood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to condense a body
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:23.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,and by linking our Divine Senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was able to bypass the restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to walk out of the Sky Demon Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Despicable !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:36.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancient Demon Spirit fragments have been separated for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we don't fuse soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:40.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will completely dissipate to return to the heavens and the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:43.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our fusion will begin the process of rebirth !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will also devour them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wish !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third thing you need to do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:56.09,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1544,481)}Fire Demon Tower\NFire Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is also the most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:57.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enter the Fire Demon Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and destroy the Fire Demon statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Statues are the source of our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will win this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I devour the Fire Demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will tell you where your friend is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:13.01,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1538,508)}Fire Demon avatar\NPeak Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:16.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of the Fire Demon and his avatar both come from the statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's destroyed, they both die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:20.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will do my best to hold back his original body
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and help you kill the avatar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,to destroy the statue as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You condensed a body with his blood
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's only a temporary measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Within my Fire Demon Country,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't defeat me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait until I devour that brat with the Ancient God aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,One day, the one who unites the 9 demons
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be me !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Treacherous brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,your opponent !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get away from me !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:21.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,now !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ling Tianhou's sword energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:15.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been apart for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:52.01,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1518,504)\fad(300,300)}7-colored Space\NWang Lin's Sea of Consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:12:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've mastered the Attraction technique !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the spells I learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:21.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,After you destroy the statue,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:23.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will help you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,to obtain the Ancient Demon inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may choose one spell to cultivate to completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Apart from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've only given this inheritance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,to two other cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,was one of the most talented
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who was it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That day, I saw a similar scene
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:52.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,within the All-Seer's Sea of Consciousness...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This 7-colored space is a spell that should only be unlocked
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,after Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, with the Ancient Demon inheritance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am experiencing it ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.33,0:14:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can choose one spell to cultivate to completion...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:35.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,a strand of slaughter energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can this be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:42.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I cultivate the Celestial Slaughter Art to completion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will die on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and become one of the All-Seer's Life Seals...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Slaughter Art
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:55.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far too vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I haven't fully cultivated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'm afraid I would have fallen for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:05.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sun Yun's disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,was also related to this...
Dialogue: -1,0:15:05.45,0:15:06.73,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,000)\move(1406,756,1236,562)\frz(12)\fry(2)}Purple Cloud Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:08.01,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,100)\frz(12)\fry(2)\move(1236,562, 1212,503)}Purple Cloud Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,All-Seer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I told you that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you don't betray me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would never betray you in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you betray me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,How was your comprehension ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:33.17,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1591,478)}Bei Luo\NAncient Demon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Bei Luo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:38.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I successfully devoured the Fire Demon fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need to use your blood anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,to step out of the Sky Demon Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Within 100 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fuse with the remaining 7 fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:50.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Ancient Demon Bei Luo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:15:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,your contribution was indispensable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.81,0:16:03.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,While you were meditating during the past few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I found the location of your friend's Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,That place collapses
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,once every 500 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it collapses,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will suck numerous artifacts and Spirit Beasts from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the root of the tide in the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,has become a bottomless abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,after the countless tides.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:32.49,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1579,500)}Tide Abyss\NWater Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,People also call it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Tide Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your friend is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,That place is unfathomably deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you certain you want to go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to repay my friend's kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 6 entrances to the Tide Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,but only a single exit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,located in Fire Demon Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only sense that your friend is closest to the Water Demon Country's entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I can't find
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,his exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:10.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just merge your Divine Sense into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you'll be able to see everything inside the Tide Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior Ancient Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This boy has the aura of the royal Ancient God bloodline...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could devour him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would be a great tonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:34.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if my Ancient Demon Clan survived until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancient Gods might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:38.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Devouring this boy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't worth the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,while I, Bei Luo, can resist this temptation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Ancient Devil Ta Jia
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be able to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my guess is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,they should also be within the Tide Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must find Senior Zhou Yi as soon as possible !
