Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.94,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:09.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:15.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:15.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:22.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:22.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:28.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.86,0:19:28.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:36.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:36.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:40.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:44.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:44.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:50.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:50.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:54.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:54.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:57.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I contemplate the wisdom of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:57.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I shall choose my path between karma and fate.
